kávy v Jeseníku.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "9ccf895", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "0920118", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "02", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "76be860", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Nabídka zdarma", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "9db637d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Dostanete jasnou cenu, rozsah a termín. Bez skrytých položek.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "c5454af", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "2ac1c79", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "03", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d603b8b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Struktura webu", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "262b79c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Navrhneme, jaké stránky web potřebuje a jak po nich návštěvník dojde k poptávce.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "7849410", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "75f2b24", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "04", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "34cf250", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Obsah", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6d14b82", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pomůžeme s texty, které prodávají a zároveň dobře fungují ve vyhledávačích.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "51f9f21", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "3d59730", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "05", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "57e4f96", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Design", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7760ec9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Grafický návrh v duchu vaší značky. Připomínkujete, dokud nejste spokojení.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "88177cf", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "2157a96", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "06", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0f57e6a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Realizace", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "09895cb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Web postavíme na WordPressu s Elementorem, u individuálních projektů na October CMS.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "cc1f85e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "abe91b5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "07", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6e1f307", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Spuštění", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1bd4962", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Doména, hosting, SSL, Analytics, Search Console a kontrola všech formulářů.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "11c03d2", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "e844d2b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "08", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "52b64ac", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Péče po spuštění", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "122cfe5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Aktualizace, zálohy, úpravy a další rozvoj webu podle výsledků.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "68a30e3", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "detail"}, "elements": [{"id": "e926990", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-legal-wrap ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "429e948", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Proč tvorba webu na míru místo šablony", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "483f057", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Web z online stavebnice vypadá podobně jako tisíce dalších a často naráží na limity – v SEO, ve vlastnictví dat i v možnostech dalšího rozvoje. Tvorba webu na míru znamená, že strukturu, texty i design přizpůsobíme vašemu oboru a zákazníkům.</p><h3>Web, který si upravíte sami</h3><p>Stavíme převážně na WordPressu a Elementoru. Texty, fotky, ceník nebo novou stránku změníte sami bez programátora. Ukážeme vám, jak na to, a když budete chtít, úpravy převezmeme.</p><h3>SEO od prvního dne</h3><p>Každá stránka má promyšlené nadpisy, popisky, interní odkazy a strukturovaná data. Web tak má od začátku šanci ukázat se lidem, kteří hledají vaše služby na Googlu.</p><h3>Pro klienty z celé České republiky</h3><p>Sídlíme v Jeseníku, ale tvorba webových stránek u nás není vázaná na region. Pracujeme pro klienty z Olomouckého, Moravskoslezského i Pardubického kraje a z celého Česka.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-legaltext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "9778f39", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "reference"}, "elements": [{"id": "1f9939b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "edfe134", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "7733590", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "e3685db", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Reference", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e4f796e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Weby, na které jsme hrdí.", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "f86d173", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Výběr realizací. Celé portfolio webů, e-shopů a kampaní najdete na Yesmark.eu.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "ed5950b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-refs", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "3054f95", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "1beb53a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "7419181", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 28, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-konradt-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Konradt", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7ed0a68", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "a5f9f53", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "c110be0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · CNC obrábění", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "bdeadbc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Konradt", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5ef6eb3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro společnost KONRADT jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na profesionální prezentaci služeb v oblasti CNC obrábění, montáže a zpracování kovů. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní technický vzhled, přehledné představení výrobních možností společnosti a srozumitelnou prezentaci jednotlivých služeb.</p><p>Součástí realizace byla také optimalizace struktury a obsahu webu s ohledem na vyhledávače a lepší dohledatelnost služeb v oblasti CNC frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2a48111", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "e077f2e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "1bdb4c0", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f49e9b4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 29, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Monika Veličková", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "05b7d45", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "2efbdeb", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a3a2586", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Reality Jeseníky", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a91a315", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Monika Veličková", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "89e2fed", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro realitní makléřku Moniku Veličkovou jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na prezentaci nemovitostí a realitních služeb v Jeseníkách. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní a osobitý design, přehlednou prezentaci nabízených nemovitostí a především na budování osobní značky, která staví na znalosti regionu, individuálním přístupu a zkušenostech s realitami i investicemi.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "73faa0c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "monikavelickova.cz", "link": {"url": "https://monikavelickova.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "5defc5c", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d3b0d6b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f92039a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 27, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-brincil-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Břinčil", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "8993047", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "0ddbce7", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "c077e74", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Technika a služby", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e76e433", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Břinčil", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "dbf73a7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Při realizaci webu pro firmu Břinčil jsme kladli důraz na moderní a přehledný design, snadnou orientaci návštěvníků a kvalitní prezentaci společnosti i její techniky. Nový web zároveň slouží jako podpůrná prezentace hlavní společnosti Břinčil &amp; Míka s.r.o., pro kterou jsme v minulosti rovněž realizovali kompletní online prezentaci.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a14d17e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "brincil.cz", "link": {"url": "https://brincil.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "de3974c", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row ww-refs-more ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "4b62518", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Další weby, e-shopy a kampaně najdete v portfoliu Yesmark.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2f6618a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Všechny reference", "link": {"url": "https://yesmark.eu/reference/?utm_source=wwwwww.cz&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=wwwwww_reference&utm_content=homepage_all", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--dark ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "dba520f", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "cenik"}, "elements": [{"id": "c933fa8", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-price", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "12e86ae", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-price-card ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f1c4807", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cena", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6e4aaf1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "<small>Tvorba webových stránek</small>od 9 900 Kč", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-price-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "40d2e24", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Konečná cena záleží na rozsahu, funkcích a grafice. Nabídku vám připravíme zdarma a nezávazně.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b734f5f", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "3558c92", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Chci cenovou nabídku", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "9bf7ec3", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "30153d5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Časté otázky – tvorba webových stránek", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7a8cb3f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "toggle", "settings": {"faq_schema": "yes", "tabs": [{"_id": "92e6b34", "tab_title": "Kolik stojí tvorba webových stránek?", "tab_content": "<p>Tvorba webových stránek začíná na 9 900 Kč. Cena záleží na počtu stránek, funkcích a grafickém zpracování. Podrobnosti najdete na stránce <a href=\"/kolik-stoji-web/\">Kolik stojí web</a>.</p>"}, {"_id": "007917b", "tab_title": "Jak dlouho trvá tvorba webu?", "tab_content": "<p>Jednodušší prezentační web bývá hotový za 2–4 týdny, rozsáhlejší web nebo e-shop za 4–8 týdnů. Přesný harmonogram dostanete v nabídce.</p>"}, {"_id": "824e46e", "tab_title": "Co od vás budete potřebovat?", "tab_content": "<p>Hlavně informace o vašich službách, logo a ideálně vlastní fotky. S texty rádi pomůžeme.</p>"}, {"_id": "f5304f8", "tab_title": "Na jakém systému web postavíte?", "tab_content": "<p>Nejčastěji na WordPressu s Elementorem, u individuálních projektů na October CMS. Web je vždy ve vašem vlastnictví.</p>"}, {"_id": "63aa04d", "tab_title": "Pomůžete s doménou a hostingem?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano. Doménu i hosting zařídíme, nebo web napojíme na ty, které už máte.</p>"}], "_css_classes": "ww-faq"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "baa33d3", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "poptavka"}, "elements": [{"id": "18c92ad", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "fcfc3ed", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "7767b22", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "4fd9fd5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "se